    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Component Check</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Inspect mirrors, lights, handlebars, and the exhaust system to ensure no parts have been displaced or broken during the journey.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<p>Following the visual assessment, the odometer reading must be verified against the original bilty details recorded at pickup. This step is crucial for confirming that the vehicle has not been driven by unauthorized parties during transit.</p>
<p>Any discrepancy between the recorded mileage and the current odometer reading must be flagged immediately for investigation, as it may indicate unauthorized usage or tampering. The logistics team cross-references this data with the LR bilty to ensure all recorded metrics match the physical vehicle state, providing a transparent audit trail for the shipment.</p>
<ul>
    <li>Document Verification: Ensure the bilty number on the paperwork matches the vehicle registration number and the chassis number.</li>
    <li>Mileage Reconciliation: Confirm that the distance traveled aligns with the expected route and that no extra kilometers have been logged.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Once the visual and mechanical checks are complete, the final step is the execution of the signed condition sign-off.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Both the delivering agent and the recipient must review the inspection report, which includes the comparative photos and the verified odometer reading.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>By signing the digital or physical handover document, both parties acknowledge that the vehicle was delivered in the agreed-upon condition.</span></li></ul>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">This legal sign-off closes the loop on the logistics chain, transferring responsibility from the carrier to the customer.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>It serves as the final proof of service completion and protects both the logistics provider and the client from future disputes regarding vehicle damage or mileage discrepancies.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This rigorous protocol ensures trust and reliability in the two-wheeler transport ecosystem.</span></li></ul></div>
    </div>
